silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_02_identifier_leg_concrete_anchor#microchipid_44 silm:hasLongDescription "The MicrochipID_44 is MicrochipID_44: the ISO 11784 RFID microchip identifier 44B2F9 implanted in Mittens; scanned at Tartu Animal Clinic on the 2026 annual exam; stored as field microchip_id in VetRecord_77. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'IdentifierSource', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
